.TH SDL_GDKResumeRenderer 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GDKResumeRenderer \- Call this to resume Render operations on Xbox after receiving the
.BR SDL_EVENT_WILL_ENTER_FOREGROUND
event.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_render.h>
.PP
.BI "void SDL_GDKResumeRenderer(SDL_Renderer *renderer);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
When resuming, this function MUST be called before calling any other
.BR SDL_Render
functions\[char46]
.PP
This function MUST be called on the application\(aqs render thread\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I renderer
the renderer which should resume operation\[char46]
.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

